OL,3,GNEWSANew MRI scanner increases number
OL,4,Aof patients
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital has introduced a third MRI
OL,7,Fbody scanner as part of a #2m extension
OL,8,Fof its facilities.
OL,10,FThe new machine at Diana, Princess of
OL,11,FWales Hospital in Grimsby will allow
OL,12,Fstaff to see an extra 20 to 25 patients
OL,13,Fa day.
OL,15,FIt replaces a mobile unit and is more
OL,16,Faccessible to patients with mobility
OL,17,Fissues, according to imaging manager
OL,18,FEve Leggott.
OL,23,APub: 07-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
