OL,3,GNEWSANew MRI scanner increases number
OL,4,Aof patients
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Having all three scanners in one place
OL,7,Fis so much easier for patients. There's
OL,8,Fjust one place to come and it's a much
OL,9,Fnicer environment to be in," she added.
